{"height": 16, "weight": 366, "base_experience": 239, "ev_yield": [{"stat": "attack", "value": 3}], "genus": "Arrow Quill Pokémon", "capture_rate": 45, "base_happiness": 70, "hatch_counter": 15, "growth_rate": "medium-slow", "egg_groups": ["flying"], "gender_rate": 1, "names": [{"language": "ja-hrkt", "name": "ジュナイパー"}, {"language": "ja-roma", "name": "Junaiper"}, {"language": "ko", "name": "모크나이퍼"}, {"language": "zh-hant", "name": "狙射樹梟"}, {"language": "fr", "name": "Archéduc"}, {"language": "de", "name": "Silvarro"}, {"language": "es", "name": "Decidueye"}, {"language": "it", "name": "Decidueye"}, {"language": "ja", "name": "ジュナイパー"}, {"language": "zh-hans", "name": "狙射树枭"}, {"language": "es-419", "name": "Decidueye"}], "pokedex_entries": [{"versions": ["sun"], "text": "It fires arrow quills from its wings with such precision, they can pierce a pebble at distances over a hundred yards."}, {"versions": ["moon"], "text": "Although basically cool and cautious, when it’s caught by surprise, it’s seized by panic."}, {"versions": ["ultra-sun"], "text": "It nocks its arrow quills and shoots them at opponents. When it simply can’t afford to miss, it tugs the vine on its head to improve its focus."}, {"versions": ["ultra-moon"], "text": "Decidueye can nock and fire an arrow at an enemy in a tenth of a second, so its battles are decided in the blink of an eye."}, {"versions": ["sword"], "text": "As if wielding a bow, it launches the arrow quills hidden among the feathers of its wings. Decidueye’s shots never miss."}, {"versions": ["shield"], "text": "In a tenth of a second, it can nock and fire an arrow quill, piercing an opponent’s weak point before they notice what’s happening."}, {"versions": ["legends-arceus"], "text": "The air stored inside the rachises of Decidueye's feathers insulates the Pokémon against Hisui's extreme cold. This is firm proof that evolution can be influenced by environment."}], "sprites_by_gen": {"generation-ix": {"scarlet-violet": {"normal": "http